[I] Transactional, image-based bootable container OS management tool

[T] bootc applies the container image model to bootable host systems, using
[T] standard OCI/Docker container images as the transport and delivery format
[T] for transactional, in-place base operating system updates.

[U] https://github.com/bootc-dev/bootc

[A] Colin Walters <walters@verbum.org>
[A] Red Hat, Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] base/tool
